v 3
d 'SLIDEGRAPH': module to automate stepped and layered graphs for presentation slides
d
d slidegraph automates the creation of layered, stepped sequence graphs for
d presentation slides (such as LaTeX Beamer or PowerPoint builds) by plotting
d all series in every frame and modulating visibility via Stata opacity
d modifiers (%0, %20, etc.), keeping axes, ticks, and legends stationary.
d
d KW: graphics
d KW: presentations
d KW: Beamer
d KW: slides
d KW: twoway
d
d Requires: Stata version 15.0
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261106
d
d Author: Aaron Wolf, Northwestern University
d Support: email aaron.wolf@u.northwestern.edu
d Project: https://github.com/aarondwolf/slidegraph
d Report issues: https://github.com/aarondwolf/slidegraph/issues
d
f slidegraph.ado
f slidegraph.sthlp
f slidegraph_demo.do
e
